    "contentHtml": "<p>Full Burst RPG: BrownDust2.<strong><br></strong></p><p>We would like to inform you about the events following the October 7 update.</p><p>Please refer to the details below.<strong><br></strong><br><strong>■ Event Update</strong></p><h3><strong>1. Pickup Event Mission</strong></h3><p>- The Unraveling Mummy Nekyndalia Pickup Event Mission will be held.</p><p>Event Period: After the October 7 maintenance - before the October 21 maintenance.</p><p>- [RERUN] Descendant of the Great Witch Celia Pickup Event Mission will be held.</p><p>Event Period: After the October 7 maintenance - before the October 21 maintenance.</p><p>- [RERUN] Innocent Bunny Tyr Pickup Event Mission will be held.</p><p>Event Period: After the October 7 maintenance - before the November 4 maintenance.</p><p>- For RERUN Pickups, the event will proceed with the missions already completed based on the enhancements that have been made. Rewards for missions that have already been completed cannot be claimed again.</p><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-10-06-events-after-the-october-7-utc-update/01.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"849\" height=\"326\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3><strong>2. Spook-Tacular Night Login Event</strong></h3><p>- Spook-Tacular Night Login Event will be held.</p><p>Event Period: After the October 7 maintenance - before the October 21 maintenance.</p><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-10-06-events-after-the-october-7-utc-update/02.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"952\" height=\"312\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3><strong>3. Spook-Tacular Night Puzzle Event</strong></h3><p>- Spook-Tacular Night Puzzle Event will be held.</p><p>Event Period: After the October 7 maintenance - before the October 21 maintenance.</p><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-10-06-events-after-the-october-7-utc-update/03.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"328\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-10-06-events-after-the-october-7-utc-update/04.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"952\" height=\"463\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-10-06-events-after-the-october-7-utc-update/05.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"822\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-10-06-events-after-the-october-7-utc-update/06.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"804\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-10-06-events-after-the-october-7-utc-update/07.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"801\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-10-06-events-after-the-october-7-utc-update/08.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"799\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3><strong>4. Mansion Runaway Boosting Mission</strong></h3><p>- Mansion Runaway Boosting Mission will be held.</p><p>Event Period: After the October 7 maintenance - before the November 4 maintenance.</p><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-10-06-events-after-the-october-7-utc-update/09.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"715\" height=\"340\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3><strong>5. Loyal Maid Season Event Boosting Mission</strong></h3><p>- Play the Season Event \"Loyal Maid\" and earn Dias.</p><p>Event Period: After the October 7 maintenance - before the October 21 maintenance.</p><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-10-06-events-after-the-october-7-utc-update/10.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1158\" height=\"316\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3><strong>6. Loyal Maid Season Pass</strong></h3><p>- Loyal Maid Season Pass will be added.</p><p>Event Period: After the October 7 maintenance - before the November 4 maintenance.</p><p>- Completing missions will grant pass experience and various rewards. The mission list and pass rewards are as follows:</p><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-10-06-events-after-the-october-7-utc-update/11.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"807\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3><strong>7. Webshop Coupon Distribution</strong></h3><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-10-06-events-after-the-october-7-utc-update/12.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>- A discount coupon will be issued when you log in to the webshop during the coupon distribution period.</p><p>Coupon Name: [10%] Limited-Time Discount Coupon</p><p>Distribution Period: After the October 7 maintenance - October 22, 02:59 PM (UTC)</p><p>※ The coupon is valid for 30 days after issuance.</p><p>※ Discount coupons cannot be used in combination.</p><p><br>Thank you.</p>"
