    "imageCount": 16,
    "contentHtml": "<p>Full Burst RPG: BrownDust2.<strong><br></strong></p><p>We would like to inform you about the events following the September 22 update.</p><p>Please refer to the details below.<strong><br></strong></p><p>■ Event Update</p><h3><strong><em>1. Pickup Event Mission</em></strong></h3><p>- Lord of the Cosmos Ren Yamashiro Pickup Event Mission will be held.</p><p>Event Period: After the September 22 maintenance - before the October 7 maintenance.</p><p>- [RERUN] Faithful Wings Olivier Pickup Event Mission will be held.</p><p>Event Period: After the September 22 maintenance - before the October 7 maintenance.</p><p>- [RERUN] Medical Club Teresse Pickup Event Mission will be held.</p><p>Event Period: After the September 22 maintenance - before the October 7 maintenance.</p><p>- For RERUN Pickups, the event will proceed with the missions already completed based on the enhancements that have been made. Rewards for missions that have already been completed cannot be claimed again.</p><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-09-21-events-after-the-september-22-utc-update/01.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"849\" height=\"326\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3><strong>2. Chained Soldier 2 Collaboration Login Event 2</strong></h3><p>- Chained Soldier 2 Collaboration Login Event 2 will be held.</p><p>Event Period: After the September 22 maintenance - before the October 7 maintenance.</p><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-09-21-events-after-the-september-22-utc-update/02.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"703\" height=\"366\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3><strong>3. Chained Soldier 2 Collaboration Growth Event Mission</strong></h3><p>- To celebrate the Chained Soldier 2 collaboration, the Growth Events will be held.</p><p>Event Period: After the September 22 maintenance - before the October 7 maintenance.</p><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-09-21-events-after-the-september-22-utc-update/03.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"558\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3><strong>4. Harvest Moon Exchange Event</strong></h3><p>- Harvest Moon Exchange Coin Event will be held.</p><p>Event Period: After the September 22 maintenance - before the October 7 maintenance.</p><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-09-21-events-after-the-september-22-utc-update/04.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"352\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-09-21-events-after-the-september-22-utc-update/05.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-09-21-events-after-the-september-22-utc-update/06.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"1007\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-09-21-events-after-the-september-22-utc-update/07.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"956\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-09-21-events-after-the-september-22-utc-update/08.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"961\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-09-21-events-after-the-september-22-utc-update/09.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"965\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-09-21-events-after-the-september-22-utc-update/10.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"948\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3><strong>5. Time to Submit Season Event Boosting Mission Event</strong></h3><p>- Play the Season Event \"Time to Submit\" and earn Dias.</p><p>Event Period: After the September 22 maintenance - before the October 7 maintenance.</p><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-09-21-events-after-the-september-22-utc-update/11.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1158\" height=\"316\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3><strong>6. Mini Season Event 'Mooncake Wishes'</strong></h3><p>- Mini Season Event 'Mooncake Wishes' will be held.</p><p>Event Period: September 23, 15:00 (UTC) - September 2, 23:59 (UTC)</p><p>- Exchange Shop currency can be obtained through quizzes and the completion rewards are as follows.</p><p><strong>※ Number of Quizzes and Currency Earned</strong></p><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-09-21-events-after-the-september-22-utc-update/12.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"92\" loading=\"lazy\"><p><br><strong>※ Completion Reward</strong></p><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-09-21-events-after-the-september-22-utc-update/13.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"967\" height=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3><strong>7. Lecliss Character Pass</strong></h3><p>- The character pass of Lecliss will be added.</p><p>By completing missions over a total of 7 days, you can obtain Lecliss's costume [Killer Doll] and her Exclusive Gear SR grade [Soul Curtana].</p><p>Event Period: After the September 22 maintenance - before the October 7 maintenance.</p><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-09-21-events-after-the-september-22-utc-update/14.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"1225\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-09-21-events-after-the-september-22-utc-update/15.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"709\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3><strong>8. Webshop Coupon Distribution</strong></h3><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-09-21-events-after-the-september-22-utc-update/16.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>- A discount coupon will be issued when you log in to the webshop during the coupon distribution period.</p><p>Coupon Name: [10%] Limited-Time Discount Coupon</p><p>Distribution Period: After the September 22 maintenance - October 8, 14:59 (UTC)</p><p>※ The coupon is valid for 30 days after issuance.</p><p>※ Discount coupons cannot be used in combination.<br><br>Thank you.</p>"
