    "contentHtml": "<p>Full Burst RPG: BrownDust2.<strong><br></strong></p><p>We would like to inform you about the events following the September 9 update.</p><p>Please refer to the details below.<strong><br></strong></p><p>■ Event Update</p><h3><strong><em>1. Pickup Event Mission</em></strong></h3><p>- Ame-no-Mitori Tenka Izumo Pickup Event Mission will be held.</p><p>Event Period: After the September 9 maintenance - before the October 7 maintenance.</p><p>- [RERUN] Piercing Magic Bow Eleaneer Pickup Event Mission will be held.</p><p>Event Period: After the September 9 maintenance - before the September 22 maintenance.</p><p>- For RERUN Pickups, the event will proceed with the missions already completed based on the enhancements that have been made. Rewards for missions that have already been completed cannot be claimed again.</p><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-09-08-events-after-the-september-9-utc-update/01.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"849\" height=\"326\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3><strong>2. Chained Soldier 2 Collaboration Login Event I</strong></h3><p>- The Chained Soldier 2 Collaboration Login Event I will be held.</p><p>Event Period: After the September 9 maintenance - before the September 22 maintenance.</p><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-09-08-events-after-the-september-9-utc-update/02.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"772\" height=\"364\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3><strong>3. Chained Soldier 2 Collaboration Kyouka Uzen Full Upgrade Distribution Event</strong></h3><p>- To celebrate the Chained Soldier 2 collaboration, an event will be held where you can receive a fully upgraded Kyouka Uzen.</p><p>Event Period: After the September 9 maintenance - before the October 7 maintenance.</p><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-09-08-events-after-the-september-9-utc-update/03.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"982\" height=\"355\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3><strong>4. Chained Soldier 2 Collaboration Growth Event Mission</strong></h3><p>- To celebrate the Chained Soldier 2 collaboration, the Growth Events will be held.</p><p>Event Period: After the September 9 maintenance - before the October 7 maintenance.</p><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-09-08-events-after-the-september-9-utc-update/04.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"493\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-09-08-events-after-the-september-9-utc-update/05.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"490\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3><strong>5. Mato Defense Force's 7th Squad Special Roulette Event</strong></h3><p>- Mato Defense Force's 7th Squad Special Roulette Event will be held.</p><p>Event Period: After the September 9 maintenance - before the October 7 maintenance.<br>※ You can play the Roulette once for free each day.</p><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-09-08-events-after-the-september-9-utc-update/06.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"859\" height=\"876\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3></h3><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-09-08-events-after-the-september-9-utc-update/07.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"899\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3></h3><h3><strong>6. Moonrise Season Pass</strong></h3><p><br>- Moonrise Season Pass will be added.</p><p>Event Period: After the September 9 maintenance - before the October 7 maintenance.<br>- Complete missions to earn Pass EXP and various rewards. The mission list and Pass rewards are as follows.</p><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-09-08-events-after-the-september-9-utc-update/08.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"277\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-09-08-events-after-the-september-9-utc-update/09.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"596\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3><strong>7. Webshop Coupon Distribution</strong></h3><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-09-08-events-after-the-september-9-utc-update/10.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>- A discount coupon will be issued when you log in to the webshop during the coupon distribution period.</p><p>Coupon Name: [10%] Limited-Time Discount Coupon</p><p>Distribution Period: After the September 9 maintenance - September 23, 02:59 PM (UTC)</p><p>※ The coupon is valid for 30 days after issuance.</p><p>※ Discount coupons cannot be used in combination.<br><br>Thank you.</p>"
