    "contentHtml": "<p>Full Burst RPG: BrownDust2.<strong><br></strong></p><p>We would like to inform you about the events following the August 26 update.</p><p>Please refer to the details below.<strong><br></strong></p><p>■ Event Update</p><h3><strong><em>1. Pickup Event Mission</em></strong></h3><p>- Savage Warrior Aquila Pickup Event Mission will be held.</p><p>Event Period: After the August 26 maintenance - before the September 9 maintenance.</p><p>- [RERUN] Young Lady Blade Pickup Event Mission will be held.</p><p>Event Period: After the August 26 maintenance - before the September 22 maintenance.</p><p>- For RERUN Pickups, the event will proceed with the missions already completed based on the enhancements that have been made. Rewards for missions that have already been completed cannot be claimed again.</p><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-08-25-events-after-the-august-26-utc-update/01.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"849\" height=\"326\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3><strong>2. Way of the Demon Login Event</strong></h3><p>- The Way of the Demon Login Event will be held.</p><p>Event Period: After the August 26 maintenance - before the September 9 maintenance.</p><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-08-25-events-after-the-august-26-utc-update/02.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"739\" height=\"372\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>※ An issue was found with the Day 5 login reward, so additional compensation has been distributed. Please claim Paid Torch x120 from your in-game mailbox.</p><h3><strong>3. Ghenar Colosseum Puzzle Event</strong></h3><p>- Ghenar Colosseum Puzzle Event will be held</p><p>Event Period: After the August 26 maintenance - before the September 9 maintenance.</p><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-08-25-events-after-the-august-26-utc-update/03.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"658\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3><strong>4. Untamed Season Event Boosting Mission</strong></h3><p>- Play the Season Event \"Untamed\" and earn Dias.</p><p>Event Period: After the August 26 maintenance - before the September 9 maintenance.</p><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-08-25-events-after-the-august-26-utc-update/04.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1158\" height=\"316\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3><strong>5. Darian Character Pass</strong></h3><p>- The Darian Character Pass event will begin.</p><p>By completing missions over a total of 7 days, you can obtain Darian's Costume [Prophetic Dream] and her SR-grade Exclusive Gear [Revelatio].</p><p>Event Period: After the August 26 maintenance - before the September 9 maintenance.</p><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-08-25-events-after-the-august-26-utc-update/05.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"1081\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/brown-dust-2/updates/2026-08-25-events-after-the-august-26-utc-update/06.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"828\" height=\"526\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3><strong>6. Webshop Coupon Distribution</strong></h3><p>- A discount coupon will be issued when you log in to the webshop during the coupon distribution period.</p><p>Coupon Name: [10%] Limited-Time Discount Coupon</p><p>Distribution Period: After the August 26 maintenance - September 10, 02:59 PM (UTC).</p><p>※ The coupon is valid for 30 days after issuance.</p><p>※ Discount coupons cannot be used in combination.<br><br><br>Thank you.</p>"
